#: ../../source/start/install.md:12
msgid ""
"The engine is a **Rust crate that is also a Python extension module**. "
"`import freeports` from Python imports the compiled extension itself — "
"there is no Python source tree underneath it — and the `freeports` "
"command is a native binary built from the same crate. This matters for "
"installation only in that building from source needs a Rust toolchain as "
"well as Python."
